        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Count a brief action",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Put 一下 after a verb to present a brief or tentative action. It measures an action, rather than an object.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "你看一下。",
                "pinyin": "nǐ kàn yīxià 。",
                "meaning": "Have a quick look.",
                "audio": "2a283bead2df38ec56bdebc350edfdf5e7feca0bd35fb5e60af9d20a0dcdff8b"
              },
              {
                "text": "我想一下。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ xiǎng yīxià 。",
                "meaning": "Let me think for a moment.",
